        "end": 262375
      },
      {
        "word": "Mana, mana alli ashnanka, mana alli ashnanchu.",
        "start": 262885,
        "end": 266295
      },
      {
        "word": "Ari, ari, makita satishpa, ashnan, petróleo hicharishka.",
        "start": 266315,
        "end": 270255
      },
      {
        "word": "Iskun derramekunamari tiyan, kay pozo kallarishkamanta, tubo pakirishpa, ninan llaki apashkamari kan.",
        "start": 270420,
        "end": 276940
      },
      {
        "word": "Maypitakyari, petróleopa hatun pukyukunaka maypitakyari?",
